# 一、项目身份继续锁死

DESIGN-LAB 是：

# Creative Execution OS

完整闭环：

```text
Brief
↓
Requirement
↓
Creative Job
↓
Operation
↓
Professional Tool / Generator
↓
Editable Asset
↓
Readback
↓
Localized Revision
↓
QA
↓
Human Jury
↓
Delivery
↓
Provenance

```

