- Asset / AssetVersion
- QA
- Jury
- Rights
- Preflight
- Editable Delivery
- Production Provenance

不拥有：

- Agent OS
- 通用聊天
- 第二知识库
- WORK-LAB Session/Governance
- ArcheAxis Knowledge truth
- Adobe/Penpot/Blender 私有 DB

