# 十六、Branch Cleanup

main 收敛后扫描旧分支：

```text
ACTIVE
MERGED
SUPERSEDED
HISTORICAL_KEEP
SAFE_TO_DELETE
UNKNOWN

```

重点不要误 merge：

- old H3 E3
- old governance closure
- old Adobe handoff
- old adapter experiment

branch 名称重要不代表应该合并。

